IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ehi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Dove corri? Non avrai mica
un altro appuntamento?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Posso andare da {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
dopo, da sola, se vuoi.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Mi spieghi che vuoi fare?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Scusa, vieni con me.
Sì, ne ho abbastanza...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Oye, yo no sé por qué tienes
tanta prisa{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Cálmate un
poquito y pisa el freno!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¿No tenías que ir a buscarme?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Eso te había dicho {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}, ¿no?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Quieres que nos olvidemos de eso?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
¡Ahora te llevo!
¡Lo dejo!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Senti, non ho la più pallida idea
del perché tu corra così tanto,
ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} datti una calmata!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Dovevi venire a prendermi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Almeno questo è quello che ha
detto {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}, giusto?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Stai facendo finta di essertelo
dimenticato?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
No, ti accompagno!
Lasciami in pace.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bak, neden bu kadar acele ettiğini
bilmiyorum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sakin ol!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Beni almaya
gelmen gerekiyordu.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} öyle söyledi, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bunu boş vermek mi istiyorsun?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Seni götüreceğim!
Vazgeçtim!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}¡Oh, no!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Podrías habérmelo
dicho antes!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Iré a casa de {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} yo sola!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
¡Tú ve a ocuparte de tus cosas!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ah be!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Baştan söyleseydin ya!


{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}'ın evine kendi başıma giderim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Sen işine bak!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} quiere verme?{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Vaya, si es que siempre te lían
para hacer de todo, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oye, mejor ven a verme de nuevo
cuando estés menos liad{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, ¿no?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Te
estaré esperando, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} will was von mir?{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Mann, du bist echt engagiert –{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kein Job ist dir zu blöd!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Komm doch später bei mir vorbei,
wenn du nichts mehr zu tun hast.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dann können wir zusammen gehen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} beni görmek mi istiyor?{{TAG:0003:0024:}} Dostum,
sen de her işe karışmışsın ha?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Şu işini bitirince yine uğrasana.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
O zaman seninle gelirim! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Oh beh, hai un sacco da fare{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Devi occuparti dei tuoi ospiti, no?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Proverò a passare da {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
più tardi, quindi non ti preoccupare!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma grazie comunque, per aver
trovato del tempo per me!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
